Subject: [PATCH 09/19] HIP GCN: single-token f16 attention for D256 x 2-way
 GQA

fattn-gcn.cu, flash-decoding style: a block takes C keys of one KV head for its query heads, packed
f16 products folded into f32, partials merged by flash_attn_combine_results. MI25, Gemma 4 12B sliding
window (D256 x 2 on 8 KV heads over 1024): 49 vs 56 us (tile). GGML_CUDA_FA_GCN_DECODE=0 turns it off.

